<title>HONG KONG: Shenzhen Int'l H1 net returns to profit.</title>
<headline>Shenzhen Int'l H1 net returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.16 gain   vs 0.06 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	   vs nil (see note)</p>
<p>    Net			    1.69 profit vs 0.50 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     41.96	 vs 20.59</p>
<p>    Company name		 Shenzhen International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Shenzhen International sells optical products.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year-end date to December 31 from March 31. Comparative figures are for April 1 to September 30, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
